# Early Warning Joe close-quarters kit: Desecrate (ECS-05) and the W7 anti-xeno branches (ECS-03).

ent-CMUActionEWJoeDesecrate = Desecrate
    .desc = Drive a fist into an adjacent body where you aim. Something breaks, and the body is thrown back; a wall, table or barricade behind it makes it worse. What has no bones to break takes more of the blow instead. Lets go of a body in your grip first.
cmu-ew-joe-desecrate-done = You desecrate {THE($target)}.
cmu-ew-joe-desecrate-victim = Something in your {$part} gives way.

# W7 1B Overpressure
cmu-ew-joe-overpressure-done = Pressure bursts from your cables into {THE($target)}.

# W7 2A Chitin Crack
cmu-ew-joe-chitin-crack = The carapace of {THE($target)} cracks.

# W7 2B Pin
cmu-ew-joe-pin-start = You pin {THE($target)} down and grind.
cmu-ew-joe-pin-broken = The blows shake your pin loose.
